OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer headbutted and left
OL,4,Awith 'significant facial injury'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer was headbutted and
OL,7,Fleft with a "significant facial injury"
OL,8,Fduring the arrest of a man in
OL,9,FLondonderry.
OL,11,FOfficers were responding to a
OL,12,Fdisturbance at a flat on Abercorn Road
OL,13,Fat about 22:40 BST.
OL,15,FAs the suspect was in a police vehicle
OL,16,Fhaving his seatbelt put on, he
OL,17,Fheadbutted an officer and kicked him
OL,18,Fmultiple times. The officer remained on
OL,19,Fduty but sustained bruising and
OL,20,Fswelling to his eye and is now
OL,21,Freceiving welfare support.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
