OL,5,
OL,6,FA 44-year-old man was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of possession of an offensive
OL,8,Fweapon, threats to kill and possession
OL,9,Fof a Class A controlled drug, as well
OL,10,Fas assault on police.
